i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tlJ75V8j46EQ7kNvwHmC-v_&_nc_oc=AdpBPRdk7QZt6rGYrsaDjT_MlncLSGGFUVdH5SU8Tun87x8ogm2xt8c6uW2MJJ0pIFo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNE13fVFvI2peIbTeX2vyiWWmeKYaCAw2CZs-Y9oRaX4A&oe=6AE5E8A3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GqB1Ls2Ux3EQ7kNvwHvdlRc&_nc_oc=Adq6ECv1BPjuAuBmIgP3rfFCEc7jnKmhN7h9vnowUnhaaDQ_IF_GOICFJXICrqzKMRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNWI9sl56-xUvv3MjEeJNoMjDrEnKKsiMwT3ZVnIpoETA&oe=6AE60CDD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wdaeaP1ZGxkQ7kNvwFSuHHC&_nc_oc=AdrDh907dsC0wX8-5GahgNRQ-rPeakFPAGzUPeJ42UCPq59F40CKzGPGzmEPhVS1BvE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOI2ZCnfEbNJmynZWKgPhNUtK5CHGIwZTtq8YVMxSXmAQ&oe=6AE5FB4A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im